WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.800
Read the guest’s request, then choose a base spirit and mixers. The checklist updates as you mix.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:25.000
New nights bring additional ingredients and returning guests.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.500
The flavour preview responds to ingredient choices, including citrus and woody aromas.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:50.300
Combine taste and aroma while checking the guest’s requirements.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:04.300
Creamy ingredients add a visible texture response to the flavour preview.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:28.300
Sparkling mixers add bubbles. Taste a drink yourself, then try a different combination before serving.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:51.300
The final request leaves the flavour choice to the player.
